  "details": "Title: Can't favorite worlds anymore\nDescription:\nWhen attempting to favorite a world, the button to do so is greyed out. This occurs even without reaching the favorite limit, nor does removing any worlds from favorites cause the button to become un-stuck.\nLogging out and In, as well as Restarting VRChat, did not fix this issue.\nAn image is attached showing this bug. This world was previously favorited;  I un-favorited it while attempting to fix the button. I cannot favorite it again.\nRepro Steps: Try to favorite any world.\nExpected: The option to favorite is available, and works.\nActual: The option to favorite is unavailable, and does not work.",
